    "title": "087: Agent identity: a distinct badge and light/dark color for every role, a name pool for dynamic agents, and a visible signal outside the console"
  },
  "summary": {
    "kind": "quote",
    "span": {
      "end": 2063,
      "end_line": 26,
      "line": 26,
      "start": 1671
    },
    "text": "Several agents answering one question improves quality and puts a specialist on each issue. It also does something else: the operator reads *who* is speaking to learn that the framing has changed, which concern is being raised, and how the agents are interacting. When names and badges stay visible, that context carries through a long exchange. When they do not, the operator sees one voice."
  }
